          "_key": "js48z6z5",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Bring only very small bags as Colosseum security is exceptionally strict with larger items often refused entry. The underground chambers can be dimly lit and uneven, so wear comfortable walking shoes with good grip. Photography is allowed throughout, but the most dramatic shots come from the Arena Floor looking up at the amphitheater's full structure."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
